Response Content: {"total": 1, "offset": 0, "data": [{"paperId": "8bd381541893ee4c487a8db95dc571b2cf6ab502", "title": "Theorem-of-Thought: A Multi-Agent Framework for Abductive, Deductive, and Inductive Reasoning in Language Models", "venue": "Proceedings of the 3rd Workshop on Towards Knowledgeable Foundation Models (KnowFM)", "year": 2025, "citationCount": 6, "openAccessPdf": {"url": "", "status": null, "license": null, "disclaimer": "Notice: Paper or abstract available at https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.07106, whic
